insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The new system was adopted not because it was cheaper, but because it made the process more transparent under careful supervision, as described in a student guide.','The new system was adopted mainly because it reduced costs.','The process became less transparent after the new system was adopted.','The new system was rejected because it was not transparent.','The main reason for adopting the new system was improved transparency rather than lower cost.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_3", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'Even though the experiment was small, its results raised important questions for future research after initial trials, as described in a pilot study.','Despite its limited size, the experiment produced results that future studies should examine.','The experiment was too large to raise useful questions.','Future research became unnecessary after the experiment.','The results were ignored because the experiment was not small.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_3", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The passage implies that convenience may encourage people to use a service, but it does not guarantee satisfaction in schools, as described in a professional workshop.','The passage says convenience always guarantees satisfaction.','The passage suggests that a convenient service can attract users without necessarily satisfying them.','The passage argues that inconvenient services attract the most users.','The passage denies that convenience affects service use.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_3", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The committee approved the plan only after several risks had been identified and addressed for adult learners, as described in a policy review.','The plan was accepted although no risks were identified.','The committee rejected the plan because all risks were addressed.','The plan was accepted once the committee had dealt with the risks it found.','The committee approved the plan before considering any risks.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_3", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The decline in complaints was gradual, so managers were careful not to attribute it to a single change in public institutions, as described in a classroom discussion.','Managers blamed a single change because complaints rose quickly.','Managers ignored the decline because it was caused by one change.','The decline in complaints was sudden and easy to explain.','Because complaints decreased slowly, managers avoided saying that one change alone caused the improvement.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_3", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The writer contrasts short-term popularity with long-term reliability during periods of change, as described in a research summary.','The writer points out a difference between being popular now and being dependable over time.','The writer argues that long-term reliability is impossible.','The writer says popularity and reliability are exactly the same.','The writer discusses reliability without mentioning popularity.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_3", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'Although digital note-taking was initially criticized, later evidence showed that it could be useful when applied carefully in small communities, as described in a public debate.','Later evidence showed that digital note-taking should never be applied.','Later evidence suggested that digital note-taking, despite early criticism, may have value if used carefully.','Early criticism proved that digital note-taking had no value at all.','The usefulness of digital note-taking was accepted before anyone criticized it.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_3", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The report does not claim that remote medical advice solves every problem; it argues only that it can reduce one specific difficulty when resources are limited, as described in a training program.','The report rejects the idea that remote medical advice can help in any way.','The report discusses many solutions but never mentions a specific problem.','According to the report, remote medical advice is not a complete solution but may help with a particular problem.','The report argues that remote medical advice solves all problems completely.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_3", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
